olute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"absolute bottom-[-2vw] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(5rem,15vw,14rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em] text-white/[0.035]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\">EXPERTISE</p><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 hidden h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-white/[0.03] lg:block\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative flex min-h-[calc(72vh-5rem)] flex-col justify-between py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-20\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-24px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">OUR EXPERTISE</p></div></div><div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">專業，從理解到實踐</h1></div><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/55 md:text-lg md:leading-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">從不動產實務、財商思維到專業成長，我們把知識、經驗與團隊交流串成一條能持續累積的成長路徑。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 flex items-end justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-5\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.24em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold/60\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.24em] text-white/40\">TAICHUNG · TAIWAN</span></div><span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-paper text-brand-900\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -left-8 top-24 select-none text-[clamp(8rem,20vw,22rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] text-brand-900/[0.025]\">GROW</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-24\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">WHY GOOD ANGEL</p></div><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-md text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">從加入，<br/>到成為<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 更好的自己。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base\">Learning · Practice<br/>Teamwork · Growth</p><div class=\"mt-14 hidden lg:block\"><div class=\"flex items-end gap-4\"><span class=\"font-serif text-7xl font-light leading-none text-gold\">04</span><span class=\"pb-2 text-[9px] tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-900/35\">GROWTH STAGES</span></div><div class=\"mt-8 h-px max-w-[220px] bg-brand-900/10\"><div class=\"h-full bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><h3 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.035em] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.2]\">一份工作的價值，<br/>不只在今天做了什麼，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">也在明天成為什麼樣的人。</span></h3><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">我們重視知識的累積，也重視實務經驗與團隊交流。 在好天使，每一次學習與參與，都能成為建立專業能力的一部分。</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-20\"><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[27px] top-0 w-px bg-brand-900/10 md:left-[39px]\"><div class=\"w-full bg-gold\" style=\"height:0px\"></div></div><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">01</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">LEARNING</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">從學習開始</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">透過不動產、財商與市場相關知識的累積，逐步建立對產業的理解，讓專業不是背答案，而是真的知道如何判斷。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">02</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">PRACTICE</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">從實務累積經驗</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">把學到的觀念帶進真實案例與工作情境，在一次次接觸與討論中，累積屬於自己的實務經驗。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">03</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">TEAMWORK</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">和團隊一起前進</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">透過交流、經驗分享與彼此協作，讓遇到的問題不必只靠自己摸索，也讓不同背景的經驗能彼此成為養分。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">04</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">GROWTH</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">找到自己的發展方向</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">在持續學習與實務累積的過程中，更了解自己的能力與興趣，逐步探索適合自己的專業與職涯方向。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-12 left-0 select-none whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(7rem,18vw,18rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-white/[0.025]\">JOIN US</div><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-px w-full origin-left bg-gold/60\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">GROW WITH US</p><h3 class=\"mt-7 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">我們尋找的，<br/>不只是已經<span class=\"text-brand-200\"> 準備好的人。</span></h3></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-white/55\">比起一開始就什麼都會，我們更期待願意理解產業、持續學習， 並且願意與團隊共同累積經驗的夥伴。</p><a class=\"group mt-10 inline-flex min-w-[220px] items-center justify-between bg-[#c7d98f] px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#dbe8b4]\" href=\"/career\"><span>加入好天使</span><span class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"h-px origin-left bg-gold/70\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 py-20 md:py-28 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:gap-24\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">GOOD ANGEL / TAICHUNG</p><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white md:text-5xl\">與願意成長的人，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">一起走得更遠。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/45\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p><div class=\"mt-12 flex max-w-lg flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-4\"><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">REAL ESTATE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">FINANCE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">PEOPLE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">GROWTH</span></div></div><nav class=\"border-t border-white/15\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)\"><a class=\"group relative flex items-center justify-between overflow-hidden border-b border-white/15 py-5 md:py-6\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-white/[0.035] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"text-[8px] tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><span class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/65 transition-all duration-